How the empty strings were handled
----------------------------------
They were embedded, not skipped. The Qwen3 tokenizer maps "" to the single
piece <|endoftext|> with attention mask [1], so it is an ordinary length-1
sequence and last-token pooling reads that EOS hidden state. All 11 rows are
therefore byte-identical to each other, and no index is shifted. They are
unreachable at query time in this table and in nomic's alike: hyp_sem_tokenize
emits only ^[a-z0-9]+$, so no lookup key can be the empty string.

